ts³11098021330³1version³13³1cache_oldmajor³10³1cache_oldauthor³10³1cache_diff_default_author³11³1revision³11³1tscreate³11098021330³1text_default³1ip³265.219.208.102³2ts³21098021330³2version³21³2name³2text_default³2data³2summary³3*³3text³3= How can I acquire someone's public key =
= and =
= distribute my own? =

In that this is for the Claire files (TCF), go to the forum "Open Source Tech Gulch" and then, pinned at the top, click on the thread "PGP Keys!, Getcher Public Keys Here!".

This is where TCF users post their public keys and where you should post your public key for other TCF users.

Ideally, you want your public key to be as available as possible, so consider posting it on your webpage (if you have one) and/or on a key server (a remote computer that lets other people find your key by searching for your name or email address).
